<p>Internet Shortcuts are simple text files with two lines:</p>

<listing>
[InternetShortcut] 
<br>URL=http://example.com
</listing>

<information>The file extension of Internet Shortcut is <code>.url</code>.</information>

<p>Somebody can open the related link (i.e. <code>.url</code>  file) within  
the Epeira Web Browser to get the related URL displayed.</p>  

<information>
With Agnostep Desktop, <code>.url</code> Internet Shortcuts are saved into  
your Home <b>Favorites</b> folder.
</information>
